<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />

    <title>Need Help? - TaskFlow</title>

    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/help.css" />
  </head>

  <body>
    <div class="help-container">
      <div class="help-header">
        <div>
          <h1>Need Help?</h1>

          <p>Learn how to use TaskFlow</p>
        </div>

        <a href="/" class="btn btn-secondary"> ← Back </a>
      </div>

      <div class="help-grid">
        <!-- Getting Started -->
        <div class="help-card">
          <div class="help-icon">🚀</div>

          <h2>Getting Started</h2>

          <p>Follow these steps to start working with TaskFlow.</p>

          <ol>
            <li>Create a project</li>
            <li>Add members to your project</li>
            <li>Create tasks</li>
            <li>Assign tasks to members</li>
            <li>Update task status</li>
          </ol>
        </div>

        <!-- Projects -->
        <div class="help-card">
          <div class="help-icon">📁</div>

          <h2>Projects</h2>

          <p>Project permissions are based on your role in the project.</p>

          <ul>
            <li>Project Creator can update the project.</li>
            <li>Project Creator can add or remove members.</li>
            <li>Project Creator can create tasks.</li>
            <li>Project Creator can delete tasks.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- Tasks -->
        <div class="help-card">
          <div class="help-icon">✓</div>

          <h2>Tasks</h2>

          <p>Tasks help your team keep track of their work.</p>

          <ul>
            <li>Each task can be assigned to one user.</li>
            <li>Assigned users can update their tasks.</li>
            <li>Tasks can be TODO, IN_PROGRESS or DONE.</li>
            <li>Completed tasks remain available as history.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- Account -->
        <div class="help-card">
          <div class="help-icon">👤</div>

          <h2>Account</h2>

          <p>Manage your personal information from your profile.</p>

          <ul>
            <li>Update your name.</li>
            <li>Update your city.</li>
            <li>Email cannot be changed from Profile.</li>
            <li>Your role is managed by the system.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="help-footer">
        <h2>Still need help?</h2>

        <p>
          If you have a problem using TaskFlow, please contact the
          administrator.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
